# wip571: GRIGIOTONIC COMPRESSOR: while a knob is turned its VALUE replaces the name (ATK ms, REL ms, THRS dB, GAIN dB)
wait 300
tap GLO
tap GLO
tap GLO
turn K1 20 80
shot gt_compval_atk.png
wait 1500
shot gt_compval_after.png
turn K2 20 80
shot gt_compval_rel.png
turn K4 30 80
shot gt_compval_gain.png
turn K3 -20 80
shot gt_compval_thrs.png
